 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nSerengeti Under The Stars\nENQUIRE NOW\n\nfrom $2199pp\n\n* price based on 6 adults sharing\n\nBEST TIME TO TRAVEL\n\nJun- Sept\n\nDURATION\n\n7 Days\n\nLOCATIONS\n\nArusha, Serengeti,\nNgorongoro Crater, Ndutu, Lake Manyara\n\nSTARTING POINT\n\nFlight into Kilimanjaro\n\n\"Serengeti Under the Stars\" safari, starting in Arusha and spanning the vast Serengeti, Ngorongoro Crater, and Lake Manyara. This journey offers a unique way to connect with nature—camping directly under the African sky, surrounded by the sounds of the wilderness each night. Our budget-friendly camping excursions provide an authentic and sustainable safari experience, making the majestic landscapes and rich wildlife of Tanzania accessible and memorable. Dive deep into the heart of the savannah, where every starlit night is an adventure and every dawn brings new wonders.\n\nITINERARY\n\nDay 1\nDay 2\nDay 3 & 4\nDay 5\nDay 6\nDay 7\n​\n\nDay 1: Arrival in Arusha\n\nUpon your arrival at the airport, you will be warmly welcomed by our representative and an experienced driver-guide, who will escort you to your accommodation in Arusha. This first day is designed for relaxation and acclimation, preparing you for the thrilling adventure ahead. If the weather is favorable, you'll be greeted by stunning views of Mount Meru and the majestic, often cloud-shrouded Mount Kilimanjaro.\n\nWhile settling in, consider enhancing your stay with optional activities available in Arusha. Explore the serene Lake Duluti by canoe, discover local culture and sites on a city tour, unwind with a yoga class, delve into the aromatic world of a coffee tour, embark on scenic walking tours, or experience the landscape on horseback. Please note that an additional charge applies for these activities\n\nAccomodation\n\nMama Wilsen House \n\nDestination\n\nArusha is known as the safari capital of Tanzania's Northern Safari Circuit.\n\nMeal Plan\n\nBed & Breakfast\n\nPackage Price includes:\n\n​\n\n• English speaking professional guide;\n\n• Meals and accommodation as specified in the itinerary \n\n• Private transportation by FWD vehicle equipped with open roof \n\n• Airport Transfers \n\n• Park Entry Fees, VAT inclusive\n\n• Ngorongoro Crater Fee, VAT inclusive\n\n• Unlimited (pure) drinking water throughout the safari;\n\n \n\nPrices can vary between seasons\n\n$2199pp  6+ people\n\n$2490pp  4 people\n\n$2999pp  2 people \n\nPackage Price Does not include:\n\n• Airfares and related costs such as personal travel insurance, visas, and vaccinations;\n\n• Cost of any client-requested itinerary modifications while the safari is in progress;\n\n• Any expenses of a personal nature such as extra beverages, laundry, etc.;\n\n• Gratuity for your safari guides\n\n• Balloon Safari / Masai Village Visit\n\nWidget Didn’t Load\nCheck your internet and refresh this page.\nIf that doesn’t work, contact us.\nRefresh this page\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
